<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Barcelona FC News</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
            color: #333;
        }
        header {
            background-color: #004d98;
            color: white;
            padding: 1rem;
            text-align: center;
        }
        nav {
            background-color: #003366;
            padding: 0.5rem;
            text-align: center;
        }
        nav a {
            color: white;
            margin: 0 1rem;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        nav a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 2rem auto;
            background: white;
            padding: 1rem;
            border-radius: 5px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }
        .news {
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }
        .news h2 {
            color: #004d98;
        }
        .comments {
            margin-top: 1rem;
        }
        .comments form {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            margin-top: 1rem;
        }
        .comments input, .comments textarea {
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            padding: 0.5rem;
            font-size: 1rem;
        }
        .comments button {
            padding: 0.5rem;
            background-color: #004d98;
            color: white;
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        .comments button:hover {
            background-color: #003366;
        }
        footer {
            background-color: #003366;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 1rem;
            position: fixed;
            bottom: 0;
            width: 100%;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <h1>Barcelona FC News</h1>
        <p>The latest updates, match results, and more about Barcelona FC.</p>
    </header>
    <nav>
        <a href="#news">News</a>
        <a href="#results">Match Results</a>
        <a href="#comments">Comments</a>
    </nav>
    <div class="container">
        <section id="news" class="news">
            <h2>Latest News</h2>
            <article>
                <h3>Barcelona Wins El Clasico!</h3>
                <p>Barcelona defeated Real Madrid 5-2 in an exciting El Clasico match. Stay tuned for more details!</p>
            </article>
            <article>
                <h3>New Signing Announced</h3>
                <p>Barcelona FC has officially signed a new striker to strengthen their squad. More updates coming soon!</p>
            </article>
        </section>
        <section id="results" class="results">
            <h2>Match Results</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>Barcelona 5-2 Real Madrid (January 12, 2025)</li>
                <li>Barcelona 3-0 Atletico Madrid (January 7, 2025)</li>
            </ul>
        </section>
        <section id="comments" class="comments">
            <h2>Leave a Comment</h2>
            <form>
                <input type="text" id="name" name="name" placeholder="Your Name" required>
                <textarea id="comment" name="comment" rows="4" placeholder="Your Comment" required></textarea>
                <button type="submit">Post Comment</button>
            </form>
        </section>
    </div>
    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2025 Barcelona FC News | All Rights Reserved</p>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
